00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:00.080
pass another $500 billion green&nbsp;
energy boondoggle next year?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.680
Or is it maybe Mitch McConnell hates Donald&nbsp;
